This is an educational model of a transport hub. It is not a road-ready
autonomous transport system and must not be used to control real vehicles
(assignment section 1, "Engineering boundary").

Third-party software, the pretrained detector and the lab recording are
listed with their own terms in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
